Lanark Stone's Westie Treasures
Project Overview
Lanark Stone's Westie Treasures is a web-based e-commerce application developed as a portfolio project supporting coursework in:

AD371 Application Architecture
AD450 Data Science Development
The project allows customers to browse products, manage shopping carts, and place orders while providing administrators with tools to manage products, inventory, orders, and business reporting.

AD371 Focus
Application Architecture and System Design

